        <link>https://alephnull.org/w/recipes/flan?rev=1262359485&amp;do=diff</link>
        <description>Flan

Oven 350 degrees

	*  6 eggs
	*  2 cups milk
	*  1 teaspoon vanilla extract
	*  1.5 cups sugar

	*  Caramelize half cup sugar in nonstick skillet, stirring constantly. When melted, pour into the bottom of a Pyrex dish.
