SERVINGS4-8 Servings

Ingredients

	*  Farro
	*  2 cups Organic Farro
	*  4 cup Water

	*  Dressing
	*  2 Tbsp Minced Shallot about 3/4 oz
	*  2 Tbsp Lemon Juice
	*  1 Tbsp Balsamic Vinegar
	*  1 Tbsp Honey</description>
    </item>
